LERS, EXCIPIENTS or CREAMERS"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"<1 GRAM of FAT & SUGAR\nHIGH CONCENTRATION OF BCAAs & AMINO ACIDS\nShown is the typical amino acid profile per serving which is derived solely from whey protein isolate and micellar casein."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Absolutely no amino acids or other ingredients have been added to spike protein values.\n"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"NO AMINO SPIKING\nSPIKE FREE"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Alanine ............... 966\nArginine .............725\nAspartic Acid ...... 2133\nCysteine .............. 409\nGlutamic Acid ......4807\n(Glutamine Precursor)\nGlycine ................512\nHistidine .............. 532\nIsoleucine ......... 1439\nLeucine ............. 2357\nLysine ................. 2251\nMethionine ........... 581\nPhenylalanine ..... 934\nProline ............... 1967\nSerine ................ 1189\nThreonine .......... 1382\nTryptophan ........... 359\nTyrosine ............. 1046\n** Valine ............... 1413\n** Branch Chain Amino Acids"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"NutraBio\nWITHOUT COMPROMISE SINCE 1996"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"HIGH PROTEIN ~ LOW CALORIE"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Complete protein matrix"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"MAXIMIZE Protein Synthesis\nBUILD & Repair Muscle\n4-HOUR Sustained Release\n"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Made in our GMP & FDA inspected facility"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"25g Protein\n110 Calories\n5.2g BCAAs"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"OU D"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Allergens: Milk."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Allergens: Milk."},{"type":"Formula re: Kosher","notes":"Kosher, Gluten Free, Soy Free, & BSE/TSE Free"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Kosher,